  "published": "2025-04-01T06:06:00.9Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## [3.0.1.1] - 2025-03-28\n\n### Added\n- Ability to stop an ongoing Bluetooth device scan.\n- Ability to get the currently connected Bluetooth device.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- DECT device detection for Jabra BIZ 1500 MS.\n- An issue where a dongle could not switch connection from one device to another without first disconnecting from the first.\n- Pairing with Jabra Speak2 55 and 3rd party devices. The pairing would succeed, but the SDK would not recognize it and was waiting until timeout for confirmation.\n- When performing a Bluetooth device scan in an environment with high density, duplicate scan entries could be emitted by the dongle. This has been fixed so only one entry is emitted per detected device.\n\n### Changed\n- Releases are now also published to nuget.org",
